    "detailed_description": "A game about breaking things, inspired by the classic game Brick Breaker. You play as Blorm, a bouncing screen saver icon. He's recently become sentient and aware of his entrapment within the computer. He doesn't know who he is, he doesn't know why he's there, all he knows is that he... must BREAK IT!<br><br><strong>HOW TO PLAY:</strong><br>Complete each level by breaking every brick within the level. Bricks can only be destroyed by bouncing Blorm against them. You can Shoot a Blast Attack to change Blorm's direction and to destroy enemies. Complete the level as quick as possible in order to maximize points!<br><br><br><strong>CONTROLS:</strong><br>-Shoot a Blast Attack: Left Click<br>-Pause Game: ESC",
